 pb-20\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-heading\"><div class=\"text-center mb-10\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 text-sm font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-full mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg>Frequently Asked Questions</span><h2 id=\"faq-heading\" class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900\">About <!-- -->Islamic<!-- --> Names Starting with “<!-- -->l<!-- -->”</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><details class=\"group bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-emerald-100 overflow-hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-6 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors list-none\"><span class=\"pr-4\">What are the most popular Islamic baby names starting with &quot;l&quot;?</span><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-7 h-7 bg-emerald-50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform text-lg font-light\">⌄</span></summary><div class=\"px-6 pb-5 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm border-t border-emerald-50 pt-4\">NameVerse features 50+ Islamic baby names beginning with &quot;l&quot;. Each name comes with its authentic meaning, cultural origin, gender classification, and lucky number. Browse our complete list to discover traditional and modern Islamic names for your baby.</div></details><details class=\"group bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-emerald-100 overflow-hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-6 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors list-none\"><span class=\"pr-4\">What do Islamic names starting with &quot;l&quot; mean?</span><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-7 h-7 bg-emerald-50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform text-lg font-light\">⌄</span></summary><div class=\"px-6 pb-5 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm border-t border-emerald-50 pt-4\">Islamic names beginning with &quot;l&quot; carry rich cultural and spiritual meanings rooted in Arabic, Quranic, and Islamic heritage. Each name on NameVerse includes a detailed meaning explanation, helping parents choose a name with a beautiful and significant meaning.</div></details><details class=\"group bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-emerald-100 overflow-hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-6 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors list-none\"><span class=\"pr-4\">Are Islamic names starting with &quot;l&quot; suitable for boys or girls?</span><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-7 h-7 bg-emerald-50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform text-lg font-light\">⌄</span></summary><div class=\"px-6 pb-5 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm border-t border-emerald-50 pt-4\">Islamic names starting with &quot;l&quot; include both boy names, girl names, and some unisex options. On each name card, you can find the gender classification. Use our filters to browse exclusively Islamic boy names or Islamic girl names beginning with &quot;l&quot;.</div></details><details class=\"group bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-emerald-100 overflow-hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-6 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors list-none\"><span class=\"pr-4\">How do I find the origin of a Islamic name starting with &quot;l&quot;?</span><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-7 h-7 bg-emerald-50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform text-lg font-light\">⌄</span></summary><div class=\"px-6 pb-5 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm border-t border-emerald-50 pt-4\">Every name on NameVerse includes its origin — whether Arabic, Persian, Urdu, Sanskrit, Hebrew, Latin, or Greek. Simply click on any Islamic name starting with &quot;l&quot; to access its full profile, including origin, meaning, pronunciation, lucky number, and lucky stone.</div></details><details class=\"group bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-emerald-100 overflow-hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-6 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors list-none\"><span class=\"pr-4\">Can I save my favourite Islamic baby names starting with &quot;l&quot;?</span><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-7 h-7 bg-emerald-50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform text-lg font-light\">⌄</span></summary><div class=\"px-6 pb-5 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm border-t border-emerald-50 pt-4\">Yes! NameVerse allows you to save favourite baby names using the heart icon on each name card. Create a personalised shortlist of your top Islamic names beginning with &quot;l&quot; to compare and share with family.</div></details></div></section><section class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 pb-20\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-8\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4\">Find the Perfect <!-- -->Islamic<!-- --> Baby Name Starting with “<!-- -->l<!-- -->”</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3\">Choosing a baby name is one of the most meaningful decisions a parent can make. NameVerse provides a comprehensive, curated database of <!-- -->Islamic<!-- --> names starting with “<!-- -->l<!-- -->”, each with its authentic meaning, cultural origin, and spiritual significance. Whether you are looking for a traditional <!-- -->Islamic<!-- --> name or a modern variation, our database helps you find the ideal name for your child.</p><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Browse other letters or switch between Islamic, Hindu, and Christian name collections to find the name that best represents your heritage and values. Every name on NameVerse is research-backed and presented with care for accuracy and cultural authenticity.</p></div></section><section class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 pb-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-5 shadow-sm\"><h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-3\">Explore More Ways to Browse</h3><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-2\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 hover:border-indigo-300 hover:bg-indigo-50 transition-all text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 hover:text-indigo-700\" href=\"/names/islamic/categories/modern/1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-grid3x3 lucide-grid-3x3 w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 9h18\"></path><path d=\"M3 15h18\"></path><path d=\"M9 3v18\"></path><path d=\"M15 3v18\"></path></svg> Browse by Category</a><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 hover:border-indigo-300 hover:bg-indigo-50 transition-all text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 hover:text-indigo-700\" href=\"/names/islamic/origin/arabic/1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"roun